{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03660",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.68,
      "end_seconds": 6.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "I mean, um, hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.58,
      "end_seconds": 12.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.54,
      "end_seconds": 27.99,
      "duration_seconds": 14.45,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed. So, um, doctor, it's been feeling flat and slowed down. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.79,
      "end_seconds": 34.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "How long has it been like this? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.5,
      "end_seconds": 47.34,
      "duration_seconds": 10.84,
      "text": "It's been five days now. Oh, and dry skin and hair. That's been about the same, six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.26,
      "end_seconds": 55.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "A few quick ones: palpitations, thoughts of harming myself, weight loss or hearing voices?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.77,
      "end_seconds": 66.13,
      "duration_seconds": 9.36,
      "text": "Actually, I haven't had palpitations, thoughts of harming myself, weight loss or hearing voices, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.23,
      "end_seconds": 71.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.77,
      "end_seconds": 76.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I mean, no, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.85,
      "end_seconds": 81.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.38,
      "end_seconds": 88.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "Um, uh, that's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.45,
      "end_seconds": 107.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.71,
      "end_seconds": 113.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.56,
      "end_seconds": 127.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.25,
      "end_seconds": 138.41,
      "duration_seconds": 10.16,
      "text": "I've had anxiety for two years now. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.32,
      "end_seconds": 143.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.51,
      "end_seconds": 163.83,
      "duration_seconds": 18.32,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day. I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I hardly move around during the day. I work in accounts at a hospital. I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.64,
      "end_seconds": 167.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.79,
      "end_seconds": 171.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Nothing regular, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.44,
      "end_seconds": 175.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.27,
      "end_seconds": 190.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.61,
      "end_seconds": 212.62,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 119 over 79, respiratory rate 14, pulse is 72 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.09,
      "end_seconds": 217.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Yeah, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.53,
      "end_seconds": 221.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Okay, we'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.91,
      "end_seconds": 227.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.12,
      "end_seconds": 230.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.5,
      "end_seconds": 247.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Your pulse is slow and your reflexes relax slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.0,
      "end_seconds": 257.39,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Putting it all together, it points towards an underactive thyroid presenting as low mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.48,
      "end_seconds": 262.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "I'm, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.43,
      "end_seconds": 283.56,
      "duration_seconds": 20.13,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with an underactive thyroid presenting as low mood do well once it's treated properly. Let me just check I've got this right. You've been feeling flat and slowed down for five days, and no palpitations or weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.91,
      "end_seconds": 288.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Oh, you know, that's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.6,
      "end_seconds": 298.17,
      "duration_seconds": 8.57,
      "text": "I'm going to order a thyroid test, for slowing and cold intolerance. We'll check the thyroid before deciding on any antidepressant."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.56,
      "end_seconds": 304.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "I follow. Book a review after the results. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.48,
      "end_seconds": 310.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Uh, you know, thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.48,
      "end_seconds": 313.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}